        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "I get all my work from word of mouth. Why a site?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Word of mouth still ends with someone Googling your name to check you're real and get your number. A site with your jobs, areas and a tap-to-call button closes that gap — and Maps brings the emergency jobs word of mouth can't."
